== no_y
error[Z0406]: `scatter` needs `y`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:3
  |
2 | d.scatter(dose)
  |   ^^^^^^^ `y` is missing
  |
  = help: usage: `data.scatter(x, y, fit: none | linear = none, color: Var, by: Var | Vars)`

== a_variable_not_there
error[Z0101]: no variable `doses` in `d`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:11
  |
2 | d.scatter(doses, response)
  |           ^^^^^ not a variable of d
  |
  = help: did you mean `dose`? If you meant a category level, write it in quotes: `"dose"`

== a_fit_that_is_no_word_of_it
