  |                 ^^^ categories
  |                           ------ a line is asked for here
  |
  = help: a least-squares line needs a number along each axis; along `x` a date will do, and is counted in days. Leave `fit:` out for the points alone

== a_line_through_dates_along_y
error[Z0401]: `fit: linear` of `scatter` fits a line of `y` on `x`, so `y` must be numbers, but `day` is placed on a scale of dates
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:17
  |
2 | d.scatter(dose, day, fit: linear)
  |                 ^^^ dates
  |                           ------ a line is asked for here
  |
  = help: a least-squares line needs a number along each axis; along `x` a date will do, and is counted in days. Leave `fit:` out for the points alone

